{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 972,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61a5b5c0dcb5b0f952b9f364",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在训练中可获得的速度或耐力等<color=#ff9900>基础能力</color>\\n与<color=#ff9900>比赛表现</color>息息相关。\\n根据比赛的<color=#ff9900>距离</color>和赛马娘的<color=#ff9900>脚质</color>，所需的能力也会有很大的\\n不同，尝试指定<color=#ff9900>与您负责的赛马娘相符的训练计划</color>\\n吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "841111d466109f4a6a8531c2f8d80a8522bf996b882392cf435b277c77ee5137",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "49"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a6a154fae697854cfc0332c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "尝试<color=#ff9900>编组</color>支援卡吧。\\n可获得编入角色的<color=#ff9900>支援效果</color>，\\n卡片相应的<color=#ff9900>育成事件</color>也会容易发生。\\n另外请注意，育成赛马娘和支援卡角色\\n不可编入<color=#ff9900>相同角色</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79cfe95a54a3318554362f27054f324a8a9b629a3700e4d554a4974e348f5f1e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:379986800138f21a4588ffa0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "举行比赛的<color=#ff9900>马场</color>和<color=#ff9900>距离</color>都各不相同。\\n赛马娘根据<color=#ff9900>马场适性・距离适性</color>也有擅长的跑道和\\n不擅长的跑道。\\n<color=#ff9900>以比赛一览中带有★号的比赛</color>为中心参赛\\n来取得胜利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26030c689e0b2229335a4d2019f607a45b4c4d100e9042b454e6c8e74faa3919",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "50"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5bfdbce8ac6b3cd4dcdd5f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛分为<color=#ff9900>Preopen・Open・GⅢ・GⅡ・GⅠ</color>五个\\n等级。\\n要获得闪耀系列赛的最高峰GⅠ比赛的胜利\\n首先从<color=#ff9900>Preopen・Open</color>的胜利开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "974fe1681fd27f918f2494349792fccef5ddd3f074fc80786ca2edb38a055e78",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "51"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9fbb3c830dc24680da0438c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过消耗<color=#ff9900>体力</color>来进行<color=#ff9900>训练</color>，\\n可以令赛马娘的<color=#ff9900>基础能力</color>得到成长。\\n智力训练除了能够<color=#ff9900>回复</color>体力之外，\\n还能比其他训练项目获得更多<color=#ff9900>技能点数</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bcdb6659d91362511e31a33a9faea21f2ff04fcfb6e88875d4052fa3bd76325",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "52"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fa147a463a9c6ec64b43425",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与<color=#ff9900>支援卡</color>编入的赛马娘一起训练，\\n能够提高<color=#ff9900>训练效率</color>和<color=#ff9900>牵绊值</color>。\\n累积牵绊值后会发生<color=#ff9900>友情训练</color>。\\n另外，支援赛马娘以外的角色看到\\n训练时，可以得到<color=#ff9900>各种好处</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12e680dcd07ea9ca94e4a7058e10de55f34c784322dea63c8e8a9360650880d6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "53"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a28d2c430ae0877732d56eaf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练时支援赛马娘带有<color=#ff9900>「！」标记</color>时\\n是<color=#ff9900>折扣 Lv提升</color>的好机会！\\n训练成功后，<color=#ff9900>伙伴所带有的\\n技能折扣 Lv</color>将提高。\\n折扣 Lv提高后，将会为<color=#ff9900>学习技能所需的技能点数打折</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34c42b29bf43f0af877177098fe9ecf285805ba33dfcb08007640a00d3fc181b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bf8a5847cd2695ae9c41959",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛马娘的<color=#ff9900>体力很少</color>的状态下若进行训练，\\n可能会训练<color=#ff9900>失败</color>而无法提升能力值。\\n训练失败的话存在<color=#ff9900>各种坏处</color>，\\n所以请多注意<color=#ff9900>体力</color>和<color=#ff9900>失败率</color>的情况！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84fad38b7823211d401dfa98e07fb0eac71e57b508599293a97c78f3f7007273",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "55"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6158401079c4a7eb1ff6d901",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过消耗<color=#ff9900>技能点数</color>来获取在可比赛中发动的<color=#ff9900>技能</color>\\n技能发动的条件有<color=#ff9900>比赛距离</color>或赛马娘的<color=#ff9900>作战策略</color>等\\n各种各样的条件，根据<color=#ff9900>距离适性</color>和<color=#ff9900>脚质适性</color>来获取\\n相符合的技能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b9d153e52cd875109cc82feca02a7e79f8a6734eeaf1c1c1f108ee338011b6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9cfa05e29184a7dfdc03c6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据<color=#ff9900>支援卡事件</color>或<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘事件</color>的结果\\n可能会提高技能的<color=#ff9900>折扣 Lv</color>。\\n与折扣 Lv相应的<color=#ff9900>技能点数消耗将会打折</color>，\\n将拥有你想获得的技能的支援卡加入编组来获取技能吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9402382f108b544e84984495fef4265f797b2fe0003796608d8d99adb3d4d2d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "57"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef697baa7987c8561f7a82a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "技能主要有以下3种分类。\\n・<color=#ff9900>固有技能</color>：育成赛马娘在最初便已获得的特殊技能。\\n・<color=#ff9900>稀有技能</color>：可在特殊场合下通过折扣事件获得的强力技能。\\n・<color=#ff9900>普通技能</color>：可在很多场合下通过折扣事件获得的技能。\\n另外，也有仅可通过<color=#ff9900>继承特定的因子</color>才能获取的技能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "272306c7f5e13e1796d045d54a53a97e6efb3146e6649e208ea37d3a367a43fa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "58"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:365c8dc93ceece200c24c72a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "对支援卡进行性能解锁后\\n可以<color=#ff9900>提高团队竞技场的得分</color>\\n可以获得<color=#ff9900>支援卡应援加成</color>。\\n多提升支援卡等级吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4b31414b223844b3fdab3630c4e247c9fa09bba7775e2f3a7e73a656a1d6108",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "59"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da47f372762bffc3b09e04a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "支援卡中有不同的<color=#ff9900>类型（特长训练）</color>。\\n与卡片角色一同训练时会发挥不同的效果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d5af8e2533ffce2bf8fabb397a9b042eff4897ffe72d0671d0ba427199e20e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2724cda420442bd8340fb90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可阅览活动中解锁的<color=#ff9900>限定剧情</color>和<color=#ff9900>视频</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6423ed9ee01f2551176e753a4b7dcceb9f374c5c6e0115c016109c7506984942",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed45f4576dbc793c2761a90a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『赏月交流会』――这项秋季赛季来临前，让学生们互相鼓劲、帮忙的\\n学园内交流活动，帮助学生们进一步提高士气。\\n荒漠英雄对这个秋天寄予期望，她在前辈们的\\n帮助下拼命努力着。另一边，悄悄观察着的\\n新宇宙，想出了一个针对交流会的作战计划――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e2a47bac989d65851f77d43dfb7c27b5619936094eac9d181cfa5446cfabe68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "61"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4e4cfdb8dd96040aa7fe590",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "活动期间进行<color=#ff9900>赛马娘育成</color>，获得<color=#ff9900>活动点数</color>。\\n收集的活动点数可兑换各种<color=#ff9900>奖励</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26effe400be5ab2c34365c8b7aee43a0af29b31e2bd6612c8c997e26b20f1ffa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "62"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a67bd6f1f87d717bb69a7f80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "收集活动点数可以\\n推进<color=#ff9900>活动限定剧情</color>。\\n推进剧情、完成活动任务，\\n可获得<color=#ff9900>活动限定支援卡</color>、<color=#ff9900>回忆的书签</color>和\\n<color=#ff9900>活动限定称号</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c253d6b2e385738f4eede3ae634797734c6c1bb84d27e6e01490e4a022a3c5d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "63"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe06bd0b24419a3a94f8a80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要拥有<color=#ff9900>活动加成赛马娘</color>、\\n<color=#ff9900>活动加成支援卡</color>，\\n育成结束时便能获得额外的<color=#ff9900>活动点数</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5877cd53214d55c580971dcfccfddbf01330ad76b77a800e76d185be17eb09d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "64"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0120b816b8ad65dbb317e7a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完成活动任务后\\n可获得<color=#ff9900>活动点数</color>和<color=#ff9900>转盘币</color>。\\n在每天刷新的<color=#ff9900>每日任务</color>中\\n也可获得转盘币。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d44013040fd2cce37b84c33fe1e4cbfafacc237fe341f4e7d7004ee069e81483",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "65"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91c9839f07b17bc82f1e7950",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>转盘币</color>可游玩<color=#ff9900>转盘德比</color>。\\n<color=#ff9900>达成BINGO</color>后，\\n可获得<color=#ff9900>活动限定支援卡</color>和<color=#ff9900>金色结晶片</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00d8d8e2863dc7f6ef7f24cbbcc621ad841bc6f11418f1b3b6f3793cb2cf3636",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "66"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89bf413553501117649de5ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "活动期间通过进行<color=#ff9900>赛马娘育成</color>，\\n完成<color=#ff9900>活动任务</color>，\\n可获得<color=#ff9900>转盘币</color>。\\n收集<color=#ff9900>转盘币</color>\\n可以挑战<color=#ff9900>转盘德比</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40d37b264576e1893bdac410745555c5d70adfdd6d6363ab70d0fbf3e2daeeff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "67"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3b493e56ffa0fe7d0d6efa2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据转盘德比的名次\\n可获得<color=#ff9900>转盘报酬</color>。\\n得到未获得过的转盘报酬时就有\\nBINGO的机会！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffd5263cee35c7fc56afa1083a9feedb9495f61229193460089ade78f5ab7dda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "68"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88883c53caa41e65bf80fa0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "已获得的转盘报酬所对应的格子将被盖章。\\n盖满纵・横・斜中的连续3个格子将<color=#ff9900>完成1次连线</color>，\\n根据已完成的连线次数可获得<color=#ff9900>BINGO报酬</color>。\\n于第3张表前，<color=#ff9900>8次连线</color>的BINGO完成后，\\n可以更换下一张BINGO表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f4fe5ce8b242a1f4f1310e8ac612041262c0c4830b4e6533a4e3b98e856015",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "69"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d03fbb34b6646763af68d477",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在育成中提高支援卡的牵绊值，\\n再进行支援卡的特长训练时将会发生<color=#ff9900>友情训练</color>。\\n赛马娘在友情训练中将比平时成长更快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5d9576a3ee3f51a3ef07662d4c6a5fc74bda9866511c55099418eecfc99928",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e646015535bd72afea4c5b34",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加6月后半和12月后半的回合结束后举办的\\n<color=#ff9900>青春杯</color>、以队伍胜利为目标吧。\\n能够在比赛中漂亮的取胜的话<color=#ff9900>队伍段位</color>就会提升、\\n<color=#ff9900>育成的赛马娘和队伍成员</color>也会<color=#ff9900>成长</color>。\\n请在<color=#ff9900>青春杯多加取胜</color>育成强力的赛马娘吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40f0fd18e19a49d504fcaa375008c2ab73df91405fc50397072bf14c248dff2e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "70"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:739e565798157e1b6936bc5b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "组成队伍，争夺青春杯冠军吧！\\n青春杯在每种赛场都有比赛，\\n在共计5场比赛中<color=#ff9900>胜场多的一方获胜</color>。\\n<color=#ff9900>获胜可提高队伍排名</color>，\\n战胜的对手排名越高，己方队伍排名提升也越大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9bd415a6d121851bf264029e8b1274747121721e73cc59e60ede20550ed68e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "71"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b6e4431f3722bc68cd3cae2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "通过使用收集的碎片，可以<color=#ff9900>解锁</color>育成赛马娘。\\n解锁后，就可以在育成中选择其成为担当角色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be7bd677264bd827f04a3a1d8cd822cf95c1535ce5b6ecebe1de42cbb119e72e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "72"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:544d7eae3bdcf2923cd8be57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "登记3位赛马娘参赛，与<color=#ff9900>全国训练员</color>\\n实时<color=#ff9900>匹配</color>对战！\\n育成强力的赛马娘，战胜全国各地的训练员吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b78599316e6cd3aae7cf6b57e4b6aed375f16909ad261b9d47bf001a39315855",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "73"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3a7d73e72667a57a77b9baf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<color=#ff9900>公开联赛</color>和<color=#ff9900>等级联赛</color>之中选择\\n参加适合自己的联赛！\\n根据联赛不同，可登记参赛的殿堂赛马娘的\\n<color=#ff9900>育成等级</color>上限也不同。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a683db0227a1c17476a9fccf02c44b9aee26cf1bc7c48e157dd117174527d63c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "74"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ad2463340db823a7367594a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>房间竞赛</color>是可以和其他训练员、\\n一起让进入殿堂的赛马娘进行比赛的功能。\\n・<color=#ff9900>举办</color>：可以自己决定条件举办比赛。\\n・<color=#ff9900>参加</color>：可以参加其他训练员举办的比赛。\\n・<color=#ff9900>观战</color>：可以输入比赛的ID观战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8de1ec3a47c258788d658bb9483b2f22609ec112e0efbdb3b7adc8180ba91d68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "75"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72cdab2b2fad50350c304da6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以GⅠ比赛作为举办的舞台\\n举办比赛时、可以从两种模式中选择举办方法。\\n・<color=#ff9900>简易模式</color>：可以直接举办的模式。\\n・<color=#ff9900>高级模式</color>：可以决定举办时的天气和参加条件的模式。\\n比赛时<color=#ff9900>1人最多可以选择3位赛马娘</color>登记到列表。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e04c792ae32cc81ace1e81e8134aa44e8fe6e304115bc49096efefa255e5f3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "76"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c7ddbe22ef47e9a3f2128d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>联赛由3个ROUND</color>构成。\\n从ROUND2开始分为A组、B组，\\n各ROUND、各组根据成绩将前往不同的位置。\\n向着决胜轮进发，取得<color=#ff9900>优胜</color>吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "603ef0b177c259d9c26dc13020d4cd7198cb3541b54982c39ca0dab93d9eea31",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "77"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7984578fd64b9ac482bfd9eb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "举办的比赛可以从参加列表招募参加者。\\n可以使用<color=#ff9900>社团共享功能</color>或<color=#ff9900>SNS共享功能</color>、\\n输入<color=#ff9900>比赛ID</color>的话可以招募身边的训练员\\n顺带一提、也请善用<color=#ff9900>保存功能</color>，这可以观看你感兴趣的比赛。\\n推荐和朋友们一起举办比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "638c946750a9faeff94adc7f18691bedeed4f670e9dccba8ad4fd01e774c4ea2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "78"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f59a4c80708afc687392e560",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>强化素材</color>提升<color=#ff9900>觉醒Lv</color>吧。\\n觉醒Lv提高后就可增加在育成中可获得的技能。\\n强化素材可在育成或每日比赛中获得。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3547c8649be86bfece0e0fbfae915e6add8e210ff5a5b9f91aeb2c1289ccf142",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:296eab1b8700eb3ffc47cdf0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在特别移籍中，将殿堂赛马娘<color=#ff9901>移籍到其他队伍\\n可获得奖励</color>。\\n另外请注意，送至其他队伍的殿堂赛马娘将会消失，\\n且无法恢复。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60e94810dce4d8ba611f3e613977c16c55c604fa2057849d0e78c5ab77ab6311",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1631885fe7da91c48da03591",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "根据移籍目标队伍所希望的条件不同，<color=#ff9901>奖励的内容也会改变。</color>\\n另外，各招募都有期待度，<color=#ff9901>对方期待度越高，\\n送出殿堂赛马娘后可获得的奖励就越豪华</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8335fbd67c1fb95f4e87b8f0c71ab610e7a40e1b01a3aff3bde5dd178a44429",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "81"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c321821056f707bae69ffe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在期待度高的招募中，\\n可获得移籍赛马娘的<color=#ff9901>赛马娘碎片</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4a8e2d14e67d307ea2ff19f54f7d1d5a6b38143584fd08c210e10b6acb922d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "82"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cacbb9f9fa536fbfb16d8b79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "当队伍成员在训练场所出现特殊图标\\n进行训练会触发「<color=#ff9900>青春特训</color>」、\\n<color=#ff9900>那名队伍成员的基础能力会上升</color>。\\n为了能在青春杯取得优胜、\\n运用青春特训来让队伍成长吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e67c486acf2b05096e436f72915a131542e32e2119049da2f674b920e3d3ecac",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "83"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ce24e872fe26e7c414486c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "而且、让<color=#ff9900>2人以上</color>的队伍成员触发了青春特训\\n<color=#ff9900>培育的赛马娘的训练效果会提升</color>！\\n另外、参加特训的<color=#ff9900>队伍成员数量越多</color>、\\n<color=#ff9900>训练得到的基础能力和技能点数也会越多</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "139469f2a4e5aea330a4824a82a8b79251e9e170db5b0a18476e9e1c4dab80aa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "84"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b09d204d1fa33eb2f6a51c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行了多次青春特训的队伍成员、\\n会触发只有一次的<color=#ff9900>青春之魂爆发</color>！\\n触发之后、那名队伍成员的<color=#ff9900>基础能力会大幅提升</color>、\\n<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘会成长并取得技能折扣</color>！\\n<color=#ff9900>多加触发青春之魂爆发</color>、这是攻略的重点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a4693486ccfda10c7e3890f44cfd227e49db41fc2697ad1147e0c22eb65e218",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "86"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43997e857a99828fd713ac07",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可确认现在拥有的物品。\\n另外，可以使用消耗性道具。\\n一部分道具可以转换为金币。\\n<color=#ff9900>由于转换后的物品无法恢复</color>，转换时请多加注意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "945ca46dd1842437d9e046110e03cce09fde469f606ea701755f1a3b6426fad7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "87"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f0f733aba771468997959fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "随着队伍成员成长、<color=#ff9900>队伍综合力</color>会上升、\\n可以从手纲小姐那里得到慰问品。另外、随着队伍的各项基础能力上升、\\n<color=#ff9900>训练等级会上升</color>。\\n<color=#ff9900>队伍的强度关系到训练的培育赛马娘的成长</color>、\\n积极的锻炼队伍吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c097b9365a9c2463711e4b4728041a1352c1863c89c68733aff86b8caa9ec76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "88"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b835fe11f2d6223a4488d79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>队伍称号</color>是、队伍综合力和队伍排名的\\n<color=#ff9900>综合评价</color>决定的。\\n拥有的<color=#ff9900>队伍称号越优秀</color>、\\n<color=#ff9900>结束时赛马娘的成长幅度会越大</color>！\\n在青春杯不断淘汰对手、获得最强的队伍称号吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b66fa33c558ec6cb5e08257b0ef42fd432ba424b560adc331a9646f2bf6ad27d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "89"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86b17c2bbbf2eab6bbc55ca1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>赛马娘的碎片</color>来进行<color=#ff9900>才能开花</color>吧。\\n才能开花后的赛马娘的基础能力将得到提升。\\n另外，达到★3后将可以获得<color=#ff9900>决胜服</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c78a274aff13b24b1f5d642fff4864726cdb137edbd9618e6019b425c79e73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20e556249003eb7af75f68c8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>活动加速</color>是指，育成开始时通过消耗2倍TP，\\n在育成结束后可获得的<color=#ff9900>活动点数</color>和<color=#ff9900>转盘币</color>将变为2倍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ff29108ad80e2717bfdcf2ee786d20dbda8714ad25f303e65277b95e2e44b88",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "90"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c4d44a3b1aaf03ecd42cf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用<color=#ff9900>相同的支援卡</color>来进行<color=#ff9900>上限解锁</color>吧。\\n上限解锁后可以解锁等级上限，\\n可以继续强化支援卡的等级。\\n另外，SR和SSR支援卡\\n可用<color=#ff9900>解放结晶</color>来进行上限解锁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc35cf21729955f9b6454cd7d90b4e769ec54ff8b85e0d97626bb6f430baaf1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "91"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ee068039f9324b9c4b25fd0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<color=#ff9900>Show Time模式</color>中完成育成后，会按照育成进度\\n和挑战的难易度效果提升<color=#ff9900>SHOW量表</color>。\\n根据SHOW量表储存至MAX的次数，\\n可获得相应<color=#ff9900>额外奖励</color>。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a75a45b3aeb1bb782f5d0b95dc4b0912c3d5f79e14171bbec6d4e8323aa6099",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bbf1ceb7b1d72e99796a467",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在Show Time模式，育成的比赛里，\\n<color=#ff9900>比赛对手赛马娘</color>将会增强。\\n在某个难易度中观看了<color=#ff9900>育成赛马娘好结局</color>之后，\\n将解锁更高一级的难易度\\n可在下次育成进行挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "380b43ed9fcc0db7018c9a0cacc3d6c96d2ed18d029b56b86d49141b98cc083f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "93"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76a2890632808c8f8314fac2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "育成<color=#ff9900>符合适性的赛马娘</color>，\\n通过达成指定的<color=#ff9900>分数奖励</color>条件\\n可获得更多分数。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d33e89146fc0cb17f6ed5137a82db7f527896ae9f1499183bef9e3db01bed6d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "94"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:11dd99418acd6d2931644d09",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在「<color=#ff9900>训练员技能考试</color>」中，\\n每个考试项目的<color=#ff9900>支援卡使用率</color>的\\n排名都能查看哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8f5fa082dabca8dc8273e218e562f047234edf2566563de15b5afb213b2d27",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "95"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94113828ff38de5e7b9db144",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "本育成剧本中育成赛马娘没有各自的目标，\\n<color=#ff9900>获得「成绩点数」将成为共同目标</color>！\\n在新马级、经典级、古马级比赛中收集\\n成绩点数吧！成绩点数可根据参加比赛的规格和所得名次\\n来获取，育成中可自由选择要参加的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31e9e9733bef207151b0799daa2cdf7c3525453efb2c7c76fb2016d97772ad82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "96"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa4a0a397833f6826aebc35e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>达成所有育成目标</color>之后\\n可以挑战<color=#ff9900>闪耀明星巅峰赛</color>！\\n在这三场比赛中取胜\\n赢取「闪耀最强星」的宝座吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b57517a6385910033a08b10e012887b146d6b146f618ec5450b04e2185fc9d3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5614dc62614db191ffa09ddc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中入着（前五名）后除成绩点数之外<color=#ff9900>还可获得「商店币」！</color>\\n商店币可在特殊商店中兑换育成商品。\\n使用育成商品后可以提高基础能力、回复体力\\n或者增加一定时间内训练可获得的属性\\n<color=#ff9900>还可获得对育成有帮助的各种效果！</color>",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0a3e363b0ec0e716d68b82d4b0cf7b92b6081a4fa65b64938277b157b980c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83fdcf138905bb55ee9de051",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<color=#ff9900>每年12月后半的回合结束时</color>，各级会表彰\\n<color=#ff9900>表现最活跃的赛马娘</color>。与支持自己的人们\\n加深交流的同时，在比赛中取得好成绩，增加\\n粉丝数吧！受表彰后可获得固有技能等级提升等奖励，\\n育成赛马娘将因此成长！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd21063d2a6e13e46f20e63936cbe5ae82fbcfe1d80d8db1ac69634d106d4da0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "63",
        "99"
      ]
    },
